### Create a chat session (optional system + seed messages)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "system": "You are a helpful assistant.",
  "messages": []
}

###
### Get session (history + state)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions/1

###
### Post a user turn → returns job key (stream via /v1/messages/:key/tokens)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Vad är färgen blå?"
}

###
### Stream tokens for the job key from the previous response
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/messages/1/tokens

###
### Job status / final content
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/messages/1

###
### Delete session (cancels active job if any)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions/1
